  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Madaba wastewater collection, treatment and reuse expansion project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project will create new sanitation and reuse infrastructure by rebuilding the WWTP and increase its treatment capacity to 16,000 m3/d, expanding the wastewater collection network by approximately 182 km, and creating a new network for irrigation across approximately 180 Ha from treated effluent. It will also create a new transfer line for the surplus effluent from the WWTP to the Kafrein irrigation area. The construction of the new infrastructure will create an estimated 40 full-time equivalent jobs over 30 months of construction.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
